{"ticker":"JBL","updated":"2026-10-30T22:54:51Z","profile":{"longName":"Jabil Inc.","shortName":"Jabil Inc.","sector":"Technology","industry":"Electronic Components","country":"United States","website":"https://www.jabil.com","fullTimeEmployees":140000,"marketCap":28083197952,"trailingPE":27.971283,"forwardPE":12.302367,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":0.78108686,"pegRatio":0.82,"targetMeanPrice":425.0,"targetHighPrice":475.0,"targetLowPrice":365.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":9,"recommendationKey":"strong_buy","revenueGrowth":0.286,"earningsGrowth":0.888,"grossMargins":0.092259996,"operatingMargins":0.058119997,"profitMargins":0.02898,"totalRevenue":35953999872,"beta":1.295,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":428.93,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":189.6,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":0.11},"summary":"Jabil Inc. provides engineering, manufacturing, and supply chain solutions worldwide. It operates in three segments: Regulated Industries, Intelligent Infrastructure, and Connected Living and Digital Commerce. The company offers electronic hardware, and embedded software design services for analog, digital, radio frequency, power, sensor, and optical component applications; creates, develops, and connects concepts and specifications that optimize the function, value, and appearance of products for both consumers and manufacturing partners; design of plastic and metal components, enclosures, sub-assemblies, and systems, with advanced modeling and analysis of electronic, electro-mechanical, and optical assemblies; detail design, environmental applications, thermal and tooling management; develop solutions for virtual and/or augmented reality, light detection and ranging, 3D sensing, projection, and imaging; delivering PCBA design with CAD tools; and electrical and mechanical assemblies. The company also offers cloud data center server platforms; medical and consumer health devices; automotive assemblies; a digital commerce ecosystem; and smart controls and security for digital building and utilities. In addition, the company offers systems assembly, test, direct-order fulfillment, and configure-to-order services. It serves 5G, wireless and cloud, digital print and retail, industr","summary_zh":"捷普公司在全球範圍內提供工程、製造和供應鏈解決方案。它分為三個部門：受監管產業、智慧基礎設施、互聯生活和數位商務。該公司為模擬、數位、射頻、電源、感測器和光學元件應用提供電子硬體和嵌入式軟體設計服務；創建、開發和連接概念和規範，為消費者和製造合作夥伴優化產品的功能、價值和外觀；塑料和金屬部件、外殼、子組件和系統的設計，以及電子、機電和光學組件的高級建模和分析； CAD 工具提供 PCBA 設計；以及電氣和機械組件。該公司還提供雲端資料中心伺服器平台；醫療和消費者健康設備；汽車總成；數位商務生態系統；數位建築和公用事業的智慧控制和安全。此外，該公司還提供系統組裝、測試、直接訂單履行和按訂單配置服務。它服務於5G、無線和雲端、數位印刷和零售、工業","sector_zh":"科技","industry_zh":"電子元件","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-02","o":199.76,"h":202.15,"l":196.93,"c":202.08,"v":2109300},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":203.65,"h":203.65,"l":201.02,"c":203.2,"v":1117600},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":204.1,"h":208.83,"l":201.86,"c":207.97,"v":1121500},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":208.23,"h":212.58,"l":206.0,"c":210.1,"v":1116900},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":211.06,"h":212.18,"l":207.81,"c":209.17,"v":1078400},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":208.86,"h":209.78,"l":206.57,"c":209.22,"v":781600},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":209.38,"h":216.05,"l":209.35,"c":215.72,"v":1439300},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":216.36,"h":217.15,"l":213.78,"c":214.28,"v":863200},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":213.39,"h":215.3,"l":212.81,"c":214.06,"v":966300},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":214.38,"h":219.81,"l":213.39,"c":216.06,"v":1263100},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":215.74,"h":216.46,"l":210.87,"c":213.33,"v":1306400},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":212.94,"h":214.0,"l":208.41,"c":213.64,"v":1289000},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":216.82,"h":226.49,"l":216.62,"c":223.29,"v":2748400},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":223.12,"h":224.74,"l":219.86,"c":224.34,"v":2883500},{"t":"2025-09-22","o":224.42,"h":233.82,"l":224.42,"c":233.23,"v":2267800},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":234.11,"h":237.14,"l":232.44,"c":234.45,"v":2054200},{"t":"2025-09-24","o":235.0,"h":235.0,"l":224.38,"c":225.28,"v":2581400},{"t":"2025-09-25","o":206.71,"h":213.22,"l":203.55,"c":210.2,"v":3241700},{"t":"2025-09-26","o":213.56,"h":217.12,"l":211.45,"c