leXFqZEZlWF9lZHkwSkJ1TTBxcG95aVFJb1VMdm5JZ3pjQ0NySHhJZTZzZDhNY0hJc1ZvUERacGhvRlE?oc=5","date":"2026-10-09","zh":"捷普 (JBL)：我們喜歡這檔股票的 3 個理由"},{"title":"Jabil stock falls after Goldman Sachs cuts target - ad-hoc-news.de","src":"ad-hoc-news.de","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisgFBVV95cUxQanFVanJnbXo0N3RyWklXcC0tbXlRNUgtVmlRbi1FOGlKekRRb0dRajBzRmRfZklxUEJhTjdJbnlWMkVhX3VqUkJzaHR5b0xyN2FWa0Q5UTJXbWE2NHNiZlViWHY2bEg3SFhvenpONGoyYUpwcjhQUTEyRHA2YjNZZGVUalAzb0tHU1FtOTZQZXhnVjdxWnc3TEY2MTdtQkNTT2tENmlJOUhTMzhmWm1SRnd3?oc=5","date":"2026-10-09","zh":"高盛下調目標後捷普股價下跌 - ad-hoc-news.de"}],"themes":[{"name":"財報","count":3},{"name":"AI 人工智慧","count":2},{"name":"訂單/合約","count":1},{"name":"股票回購/股利","count":1}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2026-10-23","period":"2026-08-31","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/898293/000162828026067038/jbl-20260831.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"Jabil is one of the leading providers of engineering, supply chain, and manufacturing solutions. We deliver comprehensive design, production, and product management services to companies across a diverse range of industries and end markets. Our capabilities span the entire product lifecycle—from innovation, design, and planning to fabrication, assembly, delivery, and post-production—enabling seamless management of resources and materials across global supply chains. Through these integrated services, we help our customers reduce manufacturing costs, enhance supply chain efficiency, minimize inventory risk, lower transportation expenses, and accelerate product fulfillment.","zh":"捷普是工程、供應鏈和製造解決方案的領先供應商之一。我們為不同產業和終端市場的公司提供全面的設計、生產和產品管理服務。我們的能力涵蓋整個產品生命週期——從創新、設計和規劃到製造、組裝、交付和後期生產——實現全球供應鏈中資源和材料的無縫管理。透過這些綜合服務，我們幫助客戶降低製造成本，提高供應鏈效率，最大限度地降低庫存風險，降低運輸費用，並加速產品履行。"},{"en":"We serve our customers primarily through dedicated business units that combine highly automated, continuous flow manufacturing with advanced electronic design and design for manufacturability. Each business unit team serves as a single point of contact between a customer and Jabil. Business unit teams are supported by cross-functional teams, which leverage the power of our global expertise and capabilities to carry out work at the site level.","zh":"我們主要透過專門的業務部門為客戶提供服務，這些部門將高度自動化、連續流程製造與先進的電子設計和可製造性設計相結合。每個業務部門團隊都是客戶和捷普之間的單一聯絡點。業務部門團隊得到跨職能團隊的支持，他們利用我們的全球專業知識和能力在現場開展工作。"},{"en":"We conduct our operations in facilities that are located worldwide, including but not limited to China, Malaysia, Mexico, and the United States. Our global production sites allow customers to manufacture products simultaneously in the optimal locations for their products. Our global presence is key to assessing and executing on our business opportunities. For the fiscal year ended August 31, 2026, we had net revenues of $36.0 billion and net income attributable to Jabil Inc. of $1.0 billion.","zh":"我們在世界各地的工廠開展業務，包括但不限於中國、馬來西亞、墨西哥和美國。我們的全球生產基地使客戶能夠在最適合其產品的地點同時製造產品。我們的全球影響力對於評估和執行我們的商機至關重要。截至 2026 年 8 月 31 日的財年，我們的淨收入為 360 億美元，歸屬於捷普公司的淨利潤為 10 億美元。"}],"markets":[],"customers":[{"en":"A key tenet of our strategy is to develop and expand long-term relationships with leading companies in high-growth industries that benefit from global, highly automated, continuous-flow manufacturing. A small number of customers and significant industry sectors have historically comprised a major portion of our net revenue. While this concentration reflects the depth of our customer relationships, we continue to diversify our customer base across industries and geographies to strengthen resilience. We also market our services and solutions through our website and social media platforms, as well as through direct engagement with prospective customers, industry events, and targeted outreach initiatives.","zh":"我們策略的一個關鍵宗旨是發展和擴大與高成長產業的領先公司的長期關係，這些公司受益於全球、高度自動化、連續流程的製造。少數客戶和重要產業部門歷來構成我們淨收入的主要部分。雖然這種集中反映了我們客戶關係的深度，但我們繼續跨行業和地理實現客戶群多元化，以增強彈性。我們也透過我們的網站和社群媒體平台，以及透過與潛在客戶的直接接觸、產業活動和有針對性的外展活動來行銷我們的服務和解決方案。"},{"en":"In fiscal year 2026, our five largest customers accounted for approximately 37% of our net revenue, and 76 customers accounted for approximately 90% of our net revenue. The table below sets forth the respective portion of net revenue attributable to customers that accounted for a significant concentration of our net revenue during the periods indicated:","zh":"2026財年，我們的五個最大客戶約占我們淨收入的37%，76個客戶約占我們淨收入的90%。下表列出所示期間占我們淨收入主要集中度的客戶應佔淨收入的相應部分："}],"competition":[{"en":"Our business is highly competitive. We compete against numerous domestic and foreign electronic manufacturing solutions providers, diversified manufacturing service providers, and design providers. We also face competition from the manufacturing operations of our current and potential customers, who are continually evaluating the merits of manufacturing products internally against the advantages of outsourcing.","zh":"我們的業務競爭非常激烈。我們與國內外眾多電子製造解決方案提供者、多元化製造服務提供者和設計提供者競爭。我們也面臨著來自現有和潛在客戶製造業務的競爭，他們不斷評估內部製造產品的優點與外包的優勢。"},{"en":"We compete with different companies depending on the type of service we are providing and/or the geographic area in which an activity takes place. We believe that the principal competitive factors in the manufacturing services market are: cost; accelerated production time-to-market; higher efficiencies; global locations; rapid scaling of production; advanced technologies; quality; and improved pricing of components. We believe we are extremely competitive with regard to all of these factors.","zh":"我們根據我們提供的服務類型和/或活動發生的地理區域與不同的公司競爭。我們認為，製造服務市場的主要競爭因素是：成本；加快生產上市時間；更高的效率；全球地點；快速擴大生產規模；先進技術；品質;並提高了組件的定價。我們相信，我們在所有這些因素方面都極具競爭力。"}],"segments":{"seg":{"end":"2026-08-31","items":[{"name":"Intelligent Infrastructure","val":17872000000,"zh":"智慧基礎設施"},{"name":"Regulated Industries","val":12694000000,"zh":"受監管業"},{"name":"Connected Living & Digital Commerce","val":5388000000,"zh":"互聯生活與數位商務"}],"total":35954000000},"geo":{"end":"2026-08-31","items":[{"name":"Non Us","val":26280000000,"zh":"非我們"},{"name":"Other Countries","val":10617000000,"zh":"其他國家"},{"name":"US","val":9674000000,"zh":"美國"},{"name":"MX","val":7205000000,"zh":"墨西哥"},{"name":"MY","val":4376000000,"zh":"我的"},{"name":"CN","val":4082000000,"zh":"中國"}],"total":35954000000}},"peers":["FLEX","SANM","CLS","KLAC","APH"]}}